<title>MALAYSIA: Repco shares to be suspended Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Repco shares to be suspended Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian timber and gaming company Repco Holdings Bhd requested the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange to suspend trading of its shares at the start of trading on Tuesday, pending an announcement.</p>
<p>The company said this in a statement late on Monday.</p>
<p>No other details were given, and company officials could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>Repco shares closed 2.50 ringgit higher at 128.50 ringgit on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
